.TH "LIBHIDPP" "3" "October 2026" "hidppctl" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
libhidpp \- This C library is a counterpart to the hidppctl command\-line tool.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
This C library is a counterpart to the \fBhidppctl\fR command\-line tool.
.PP
The library provides functions for querying and configuring devices that use
the proprietary HID++ protocol. Alongside that, it provides functions for
simulating basic inputs, such as keyboard presses.
.PP
The \fBhidpp_receiver_t\fR object refers to a HID++ Bluetooth receiver which
allows for multiple devices to connect to it. You can interact with these
devices using \fBhidpp_device_t\fR objects.
