EINVAL, ENOENT (no such control), ENOSYS (unsupported action), EIO.
.SS hidpp_action_reset
.PP
.nf
\fBHIDPP_API int hidpp_action_reset(
    hidpp_device_t *dev, uint16_t id, uint8_t host
);\fR
.fi
.PP
Restores factory behaviour of control \fBid\fR on \fBhost\fR.
.SS hidpp_action_reset_all
.PP
.nf
\fBHIDPP_API int hidpp_action_reset_all(hidpp_device_t *dev, uint8_t hostMask);\fR
.fi
.PP
Restores factory behaviour of all controls on hosts selected by the bit
mask \fBhostMask\fR (bit N selects host N).
.SS hidpp_action_type_name
.PP
.nf
\fBHIDPP_API const char *hidpp_action_type_name(uint8_t type);\fR
.fi
