    uint16_t frame,
    uint16_t framesToNext
);\fR
.fi
.PP
Shows all changes made since the previous frame. \fBframesToNext\fR is the
number of frames until the next change, 0 when streaming live.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
EINVAL, ENOSYS, EIO.
