\fBHIDPP_API const wchar_t *hidpp_error(hidpp_receiver_t *rcv);\fR
.fi
.PP
Returns the last error message of \fBrcv\fR or it's devices.
.SS hidpp_error_str
.PP
.nf
\fBHIDPP_API const char *hidpp_error_str(int code);\fR
.fi
.PP
Returns a human\-readable string for a \fBhidpp_error\fR code (e.g.
HIDPP_EIO \-> "I/O error"). Unlike hidpp_error(), this does not
depend on a receiver and never returns NULL.
